# Actual-POT messages; reviewed against this canonical source.
msgid ""
msgstr "Project-Id-Version: Nexus source documentation\nLanguage: en\nMIME-Version: 1.0\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\nX-Nexus-Reviewed: true\nX-Nexus-Source-SHA256: 22e1772fcfa52fe579be736bd0b8ec8f383e5caef772517107c1897d8a1a0699\n"

msgid "读取精确平台支持"
msgstr "Read exact platform support"

msgid "当前生产系列入口是 STM32F4，精确器件与模式统一见[详细支持](../../delivery/support.md)。 已审料号与器件视图、四个实体 F407 Board 包及新增料号的内部 CRC 软件参考分别维护。 同系列名称、官方 SDK 文件或器件宏存在，不代表全部 F4、外设组合或实体 PCB 已验证。"
msgstr "STM32F4 is the current production series entry. [Detailed support](../../delivery/support.md) owns exact devices and modes. Reviewed parts and device views, four physical F407 Board packages, and internal-CRC software references for additional parts are maintained separately. A family name, official SDK file or device macro does not establish verification of all F4 parts, peripheral combinations or physical PCBs."

msgid "维度"
msgstr "Dimension"

msgid "当前含义"
msgstr "Current meaning"

msgid "芯片事实"
msgstr "Chip facts"

msgid "精确料号、封装、Flash／RAM 和允许路线"
msgstr "Exact part number, package, Flash/RAM and allowed routes"

msgid "实现与模式"
msgstr "Implementation and mode"

msgid "F4 provider 明确维护的有限模式"
msgstr "Limited set of modes explicitly maintained by the F4 provider"

msgid "Board"
msgstr "Board"

msgid "四个独立 F407 包中已审查的连接与条件"
msgstr "Reviewed connections and conditions in four independent F407 packages"

msgid "软件验证"
msgstr "Software verification"

msgid "精确源码、配置、工具和本次实际执行"
msgstr "Exact source, configuration, tools and actual execution for this iteration"

msgid "物理验证"
msgstr "Physical verification"

msgid "同一镜像、PCB、station 和真实观测"
msgstr "The same image, PCB, station and actual observations"

msgid "模式限制见[详细支持](../../delivery/support.md)，路线、夹具和生产源码关联见 [派生矩阵](../../delivery/capabilities.md)，目录见[源码图](../../explanation/source-map.md)。"
msgstr "See [detailed support](../../delivery/support.md) for mode limits, the [derived matrix](../../delivery/capabilities.md) for routes, fixtures and production-source associations, and the [source map](../../explanation/source-map.md) for directories."

msgid "当前可选择范围"
msgstr "Current selection scope"

msgid "启明 F407ZG V3.1、独立核心板和 V4.1 保留不同来源与装配身份。"
msgstr "Qiming F407ZG V3.1, standalone core board and V4.1 retain separate sources and assembly identities."

msgid "天空星 F407VE 青春版使用其独立封装和 PCB 事实。"
msgstr "Sky F407VE youth edition uses its own package and PCB facts."

msgid "裸机、FreeRTOS 和明确维护的 ThreadX M4 子集分别选择；启动不进入内核。"
msgstr "Select baremetal, FreeRTOS and the explicitly maintained ThreadX M4 subset independently; Platform startup does not enter a kernel."

msgid "Native 只属于 `tests/support/native/`，需要 `test_support=True`、CLI `--test-support` 或声明了 `NEXUS_TEST_SUPPORT=ON` 的测试 preset。"
msgstr "Native belongs only to `tests/support/native/` and requires `test_support=True`, CLI `--test-support` or a test preset declaring `NEXUS_TEST_SUPPORT=ON`."

msgid "Core／Arch 的 CPU 软件能力与具体 SoC 集成分开，不从 CPU 名称推导芯片支持。"
msgstr "Core/Arch CPU software capabilities remain separate from concrete SoC integration; CPU names do not imply chip support."

msgid "所有 `vendors/` 保留，未使用 SDK 的存在不扩大生产支持。旧 F103、G474、H743、 U575 和 GD32 等接入退出当前生产选择；原证据按 [固定旧源码](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18) 读取，不将旧通过值转移到重构源码。"
msgstr "All `vendors/` sources are retained. Unused SDKs do not expand production support. Earlier F103, G474, H743, U575 and GD32 integrations leave current production selection. Read original evidence against the [fixed prior source](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18); old passes do not transfer to refactored source."

msgid "使用前检查"
msgstr "Checks before use"

msgid "固定完整料号、Board、振荡源和必要跳线条件。"
msgstr "Fix the full part number, Board, oscillator source and required jumper conditions."

msgid "查看对应控制器、route、mode 和资源冲突。"
msgstr "Inspect the controller, route, mode and resource conflicts."

msgid "解析实际 TOML；未知字段、未维护模式与冲突必须拒绝。"
msgstr "Resolve the actual TOML; unknown fields, unmaintained modes and conflicts must reject."

msgid "核对同一源码与配置的模型、ARM、SDK 或候选记录。"
msgstr "Verify model, ARM, SDK or candidate records for the same source and configuration."

msgid "需要物理行为结论时，核对实际 station 原件。"
msgstr "For physical conclusions, verify actual station originals."

msgid "异步 ACCEPTED 后持续借用到 acquire 观察 SETTLED；timeout、cancel 与排空失败 不授权复用存储。物理 HIL 当前为 `not_executed`，未知 PCB 修订仍保持未知。 完整资格边界见[资格参考](qualification.md)。"
msgstr "After asynchronous ACCEPTED, borrowing continues until acquire observes SETTLED. Timeout, cancel and failed drain do not authorize storage reuse. Physical HIL is currently `not_executed`, and unknown PCB revisions remain unknown. See the [qualification reference](qualification.md) for complete boundaries."
